{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"forge_l4","model_identifier":"forge_l4","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# forge_l4\n\nSteelworks (forge level 4): a tall stone foundry hall, a brick chimney stack, and a glowing furnace mouth with a tilting crucible beam.\n\n- Footprint: 12 x 9 columns (192 x 144 units, 5.40 x 4.05 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -78..86, y 0..246, z -78..60 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 74, construction_0 33, construction_33 55, construction_66 89, ruined 33 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- hall: 128 x 176 x 92 centred at x -8, z 10\n- chimney stack: 24 x 246 x 24 at x 72, z 12\n- furnace: 56 x 62 x 28 at x 16, z -50\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `forge_l4_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `forge_l4_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_forge_l4` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 3.0 | loop | `ladle` crucible tips toward the moulds and back. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (-44, 0, -45)\n- `fx_smoke` at (72, 248, 12)\n- `fx_flame` at (16, 20, -64)\n- `slot_work` at (16, 0, -86)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (-44, 0, -50)\n"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"hall_found","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-74.0,0.0,-38.0],"to":[58.0,3.0,58.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[280.0,439.0,412.0,442.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[412.0,439.0,508.0,442.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[280.0,439.0,412.0,442.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[412.0,439.0,508.0,442.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[296.0,0.0,428.0,96.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[296.0,0.0,428.0,96.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"02ad1dc8-00a7-50b5-ab5a-62158b123dd8"},{"name":"hall_w0_n","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-72.0,3.0,-36.0],"to":[56.0,123.0,-32.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[72.0,0.0,200.0,120.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[284.0,0.0,288.0,120.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[72.0,0.0,200.0,120.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[284.0,0.0,288.0,120.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,435.0,128.0,439.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,435.0,128.0,439.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"2beb104e-ac29-513a-b08e-e2be97859957"},{"name":"hall_w0_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-72.0,3.0,52.0],"to":[56.0,123.0,56.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[72.0,0.0,200.0,120.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[288.0,0.0,292.0,120.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[72.0,0.0,200.0,120.0]